{
  "job_B16.19_20251003_114353": {
    "text": "Freode huna \u00e6t ocmund tune on mides sumeres messe \u00e6uen for \u00feon.\nAnd for \u00fea.\nOn feower wegas on brunes gewitnesse messe preostes & on ealra \u00fe\u00e6ra preosta.\nBirhtric freode hroda \u00e6t curi tune on sunnan d\u00e6ge ofer pentecostenes messe daig on.\nPreosta.\nEalra \u00feara hyred preosta & on.\n\u00deys sint \u00feara manna naman \u00f0e man freode for ordgar \u00e6t bradan stane \u00f0a he l\u00e6g on adle.\n\u00de\u00e6t ys cynsie fram liwtune & godcild of lamburnan & leofric of swuran tune dola wines sunu & eadsige\nOn wynstanes gewytnysse m\u00e6sse preost\u00e6s & on wulfsies \u00e6t lamburnan & on eallra \u00feara hired preosta.\n& \u00e6lfgy\u00f0 of swuran tune & \u00fe\u00e6r his to gewitnysse cynsie preost and goda preost, & \u00e6lfric preost, \u00f0e \u00feis\n\u00deis was \u00e6t borslea gedon for ordgar.\nEadgifu gefreode \u00e6lfgi\u00f0e birhsies dohtor hlaf bryttan \u00e6t borslea on feower wegas.\nOn wynstanes gewittnesse m\u00e6ssepreostes, & on goda preostes, & on cynstanes goda suna, & on afan.\nBirhtric gefreode \u00e6ffan \u00e6t curritune on brunes gewitnesse m\u00e6ssepreostes, & on wynstanes preostes, &\nEadgyfu gefreode leofrune \u00e6t curritune for ordgar on brunes gewittnesse messe preostes & on ealra \u00fe\u00e6ra\nByrhtric gefreode ribrost & hwite on middes wintres m\u00e6sse d\u00e6g \u00e6t tiwarhel on prudes gewitnysse\nEadgyfu gefreode wulfric on feower wegas \u00ferim ucan \u00e6r middan sumera.\nOn gewittnesse byrhstanes m\u00e6sse preostes, & on cynstanes & on clerices \u00fee \u00feis gewrat.\nEadgyfu gefreode wulfwunne on middes sumeres m\u00e6sse d\u00e6g on wulfno\u00fees gewitnysse m\u00e6sse preostes\nEadgyfu gefreode \u00e6\u00feelgyfe wuncildes wif on feower wegas on middes sumeres m\u00e6sse \u00e6fen \u00e6t br\u00e6g.\nOn brunes gewittnisse m\u00e6sse preostes & on wulfno\u00f0es m\u00e6sse preostes & on eallra \u00fe\u00e6ra hyred preosta.",
